    <string name="app_name">TLoZ:TWW HD Recompiled</string>

    <string name="setup_text">The game files were not found or don\'t match this build.\n\nThis app contains only the recompiled code built from your own copy of the game; it needs the extracted game files from the same dump. Extract them on a computer (see README.md: tools/wudextract.py), then copy the resulting folder (with code/, content/ and meta/ inside) to:\n\n%1$s\n\nFor example: adb push game /sdcard/Android/data/org.wwhdrecomp.app/files/\n\nProblem: %2$s</string>
    <string name="setup_retry">Check again</string>
    <string name="setup_welcome">Welcome!\n\nThis app contains no game files. It plays your own copy of The Legend of Zelda: The Wind Waker HD for Wii U (USA or European version).\n\nPut these three files in one folder on this device, then choose that folder:\n•  your disc image (.wux or .wud)\n•  its disc key (the image\'s name with .key)\n•  the console\'s common key (common.key)\n\nThe app then extracts the game files (about 1.7 GB) and prepares the game code for this device. That happens once and takes a while, depending on the device\'s processor.</string>
    <string name="setup_problem">The game files found don\'t work: %1$s</string>
    <string name="setup_extract">Extract from your disc image…</string>
    <string name="extract_missing">Choose the folder that holds your disc image, its disc key and the console\'s common key:\n\n%1$s the image (.wux or .wud)\n%2$s its disc key (the image\'s name with .key)\n%3$s common.key</string>
